Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:06:54 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 13/47] Plutonium: several live shells, Super+Tab switches
 between them

Every enabled shell (local state plutonium.shells, --plutonium-shells) gets a
hidden fullscreen app window beside the startup shell's. Only the visible
shell drives sizes, focus, fullscreen and tab attachment; embeds remember
their tab and take it back when their shell is shown again. Shortcuts are
per shell.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
